OL,3,GNEWSAHotel used to house asylum seekers
OL,4,Aset to reopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city centre hotel is set to reopen to
OL,7,Fthe public after being used to house
OL,8,Fasylum seekers.
OL,10,FThe Britannia Hotel, on Lichfield
OL,11,FStreet in Wolverhampton, shut in 2021
OL,12,Fin order to provide emergency
OL,13,Faccommodation to individuals and
OL,14,Ffamilies seeking asylum.
OL,16,FThe hotel said that as the government
OL,17,Fbegins to wind down its hotel occupancy
OL,18,Fprogrammes, the historic building has
OL,19,Fundergone a refurbishment of all 118
OL,20,Fbedrooms and bathrooms.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
