OL,3,GNEWSAHotel used to house asylum seekers
OL,4,Aset to reopen
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Wolverhampton is an important location
OL,7,Ffor Britannia Hotels, and we look
OL,8,Fforward to welcoming guests back to the
OL,9,Fhotel when it reopens in November,"
OL,10,Fsaid Prakash Sivarajan, director of
OL,11,FBritannia Hotels Group.
